  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The text 'a head diaper is required when you have shit for brains' is mapped onto the woman (Ms. Omar) in the image.",
  "description": "The meme uses the visual of Ms. Omar, a Black woman wearing a headscarf in a formal setting, to represent the target of the insult. The text 'a head diaper is required when you have shit for brains' is an intelligence-related slur that is projected onto her, implying she is intellectually inferior. This mapping is based on the juxtaposition of the text with her image, creating a hateful and degrading association. The mapping involves the textual insult being applied to the visual entity (Ms. Omar), who is the subject of the insult. This is a clear case of analogical mapping where the text explicitly identifies or attributes a negative quality to the visual entity.",
